        "text": "ChainDominated (heatPressureJet h) (volume.restrict (Ioi 1)); the witness supplied in the proof is fun v => pressureWeight h v * B with pressureWeight h v = v ^ (-2*(1/2+h) - 1) = v^{-2-2h} and B = jetProduct (heatJetBound h) (heatJetBound h) n — the dimensionless form of the second majorant"
